sequenceDiagram
    actor Sales as Sales/Internal Team
    actor Merchant as Merchant Representative
    participant UI as React UI Merchant Route
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant Auth as login-microservice
    participant Tenant as Tenant Foundation Logic

    Sales->>Merchant: Share merchant signup link
    Merchant->>UI: Open signup route and enter company/store details
    UI->>GW: Submit onboarding request
    GW->>Auth: Create or link merchant-admin identity
    GW->>Tenant: Create merchant company/store and tenant context
    Tenant-->>GW: Return tenant identifier
    GW-->>UI: Onboarding success with tenant route
    UI-->>Merchant: Navigate to tenant-specific merchant context